{"module":"path-forward","voice":"female","duration":153.3,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"El camino a seguir","start":0.0,"end":1.28,"words":[[0.11,0.27],[0.27,0.75],[0.75,0.83],[0.83,1.23]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Nada de esta historia era inevitable, y nada es permanente.","start":2.08,"end":6.38,"words":[[2.17,2.46],[2.46,2.6],[2.6,2.89],[2.89,3.39],[3.39,3.61],[3.61,4.4],[4.66,4.73],[4.73,5.02],[5.02,5.16],[5.16,5.96]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Cada uno de estos remedios tiene un historial, y en cada uno hay un papel para ti.","start":6.73,"end":12.69,"words":[[6.78,7.11],[7.11,7.35],[7.35,7.51],[7.51,7.92],[7.92,8.56],[8.56,8.97],[8.97,9.13],[9.13,9.85],[10.14,10.22],[10.22,10.38],[10.38,10.7],[10.7,10.94],[10.94,11.11],[11.11,11.27],[11.27,11.67],[11.67,11.99],[11.99,12.24]]},{"el":"h0","text":"Leyes que hacen costoso el acoso","start":13.04,"end":15.23,"words":[[13.16,13.57],[13.57,13.73],[13.73,14.06],[14.06,14.63],[14.63,14.79],[14.79,15.2]]},{"el":"s0","text":"La Ley CAREN de San Francisco, la ley de Oregón de 2019 y la AB 1775 de California dan un remedio a las personas afectadas.","start":15.93,"end":26.33,"words":[[16.04,16.19],[16.19,16.4],[16.4,16.76],[16.76,16.91],[16.91,17.12],[17.12,17.84],[18.09,18.23],[18.23,18.45],[18.45,18.59],[18.59,19.02],[19.02,19.17],[19.17,20.31],[20.31,20.39],[20.39,20.53],[20.53,20.67],[20.67,22.61],[22.61,22.75],[22.75,23.47],[23.47,23.69],[23.69,23.83],[23.83,24.33],[24.33,24.41],[24.41,24.62],[24.62,25.19],[25.19,25.91]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Una versión federal lo extendería a todo el país.","start":26.68,"end":30.07,"words":[[26.75,26.95],[26.95,27.43],[27.43,27.9],[27.9,28.04],[28.04,28.85],[28.85,28.92],[28.92,29.19],[29.19,29.33],[29.33,29.67]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Lee y mejora el proyecto, y luego pide a tus legisladores que lo presenten.","start":30.42,"end":35.44,"words":[[30.54,30.75],[30.75,30.82],[30.82,31.23],[31.23,31.37],[31.37,32.0],[32.25,32.32],[32.32,32.67],[32.67,32.95],[32.95,33.02],[33.02,33.23],[33.23,34.07],[34.07,34.21],[34.21,34.35],[34.35,35.04]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Otros equipos de respuesta","start":36.34,"end":38.1,"words":[[36.43,36.8],[36.8,37.24],[37.24,37.38],[37.38,38.04]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Programas como CAHOOTS (Eugene) y STAR (Denver) envían paramédicos y consejeros a llamadas que no necesitan policía.","start":38.8,"end":46.46,"words":[[38.87,39.5],[39.5,39.78],[39.78,40.2],[40.2,40.62],[40.87,40.94],[40.94,41.22],[41.22,41.64],[41.88,42.38],[42.38,43.15],[43.15,43.22],[43.22,43.92],[43.92,43.99],[43.99,44.48],[44.48,44.62],[44.62,44.76],[44.76,45.4],[45.4,46.03]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Pregunta a tu concejo municipal si tu ciudad tiene uno.","start":46.81,"end":50.3,"words":[[46.89,47.42],[47.42,47.48],[47.48,47.62],[47.62,48.08],[48.08,48.67],[48.67,48.81],[48.81,48.94],[48.94,49.33],[49.33,49.67],[49.67,49.93]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Decir la verdad en público","start":51.2,"end":52.97,"words":[[51.27,51.65],[51.65,51.8],[51.8,52.25],[52.25,52.4],[52.4,52.92]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Las comisiones de la verdad (Sudáfrica 1996, Greensboro 2004–2006, Canadá 2008–2015) y memoriales como el National Memorial for Peace and Justice de EJI en Montgomery ponen el registro donde todos pueden verlo.","start":53.67,"end":71.33,"words":[[53.74,53.96],[53.96,54.68],[54.68,54.83],[54.83,54.97],[54.97,55.41],[55.41,56.06],[56.06,58.02],[58.28,59.0],[59.0,60.75],[61.0,61.44],[61.44,63.03],[63.29,63.36],[63.36,64.09],[64.09,64.38],[64.38,64.52],[64.52,65.1],[65.1,65.69],[65.69,65.9],[65.9,66.27],[66.27,66.48],[66.48,66.99],[66.99,67.14],[67.14,67.36],[67.36,67.5],[67.5,68.23],[68.23,68.59],[68.59,68.74],[68.74,69.32],[69.32,69.68],[69.68,70.04],[70.04,70.48],[70.48,70.91]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Enseñar estos módulos es parte de ese trabajo.","start":71.68,"end":74.61,"words":[[71.77,72.2],[72.2,72.51],[72.51,72.95],[72.95,73.08],[73.08,73.39],[73.39,73.51],[73.51,73.7],[73.7,74.2]]},{"el":"h3","text":"Reparar","start":75.51,"end":76.27,"words":[[75.64,76.21]]},{"el":"s3","text":"La Ley de Libertades Civiles de 1988 pidió perdón y pagó $20,000 a cada japonés-estadounidense sobreviviente que había sido encarcelado.","start":76.97,"end":88.11,"words":[[77.07,77.2],[77.2,77.41],[77.41,77.54],[77.54,78.22],[78.22,78.69],[78.69,78.82],[78.82,80.64],[80.64,80.98],[80.98,81.39],[81.39,81.45],[81.45,81.72],[81.72,83.54],[83.54,83.61],[83.61,83.88],[83.88,85.3],[85.3,86.17],[86.17,86.31],[86.31,86.65],[86.65,86.92],[86.92,87.73]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Carolina del Norte y Virginia han compensado a sobrevivientes de esterilizaciones.","start":88.46,"end":93.69,"words":[[88.52,89.06],[89.06,89.26],[89.26,89.6],[89.6,89.67],[89.67,90.2],[90.2,90.34],[90.34,91.01],[91.01,91.08],[91.08,92.02],[92.02,92.15],[92.15,93.3]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Evanston, Illinois, comenzó reparaciones de vivienda en 2021, el Grupo de Trabajo sobre Reparaciones de California publicó su informe final en 2023 y el proyecto H.R.","start":94.04,"end":106.4,"words":[[94.12,94.72],[94.95,95.54],[95.78,96.24],[96.24,97.04],[97.04,97.17],[97.17,97.7],[97.7,97.83],[97.83,98.96],[99.19,99.32],[99.32,99.65],[99.65,99.79],[99.79,100.25],[100.25,100.58],[100.58,101.38],[101.38,101.51],[101.51,102.17],[102.17,102.64],[102.64,102.77],[102.77,103.23],[103.23,103.57],[103.57,103.7],[103.7,104.76],[104.76,104.83],[104.83,104.96],[104.96,105.49],[105.49,106.02]]},{"el":"s3","text":"40 crearía una comisión federal.","start":106.75,"end":109.77,"words":[[106.83,107.41],[107.41,107.99],[107.99,108.2],[108.2,108.78],[108.78,109.36]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Si hacer más, y cómo, se debate; los precedentes están documentados.","start":110.12,"end":115.4,"words":[[110.21,110.35],[110.35,110.63],[110.63,110.91],[111.15,111.22],[111.22,111.57],[111.81,111.95],[111.95,112.44],[112.68,112.89],[112.89,113.65],[113.65,114.0],[114.0,114.9]]},{"el":"h4","text":"Limpiar los códigos","start":116.3,"end":117.66,"words":[[116.36,116.87],[116.87,117.09],[117.09,117.59]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Todavía hay lenguaje de la era de la segregación en algunos códigos y escrituras.","start":118.36,"end":123.47,"words":[[118.5,119.04],[119.04,119.17],[119.17,119.71],[119.71,119.84],[119.84,119.98],[119.98,120.18],[120.18,120.31],[120.31,120.45],[120.45,121.19],[121.19,121.32],[121.32,121.79],[121.79,122.26],[122.26,122.33],[122.33,123.07]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Los voluntarios pueden verificar leyes antiguas y entregar solicitudes de derogación, y muchos estados ya permiten a los dueños eliminar las cláusulas de sus escrituras.","start":123.82,"end":134.63,"words":[[123.94,124.15],[124.15,124.91],[124.91,125.33],[125.33,125.95],[125.95,126.29],[126.29,126.85],[126.85,126.92],[126.92,127.47],[127.47,128.23],[128.23,128.37],[128.37,129.13],[129.37,129.44],[129.44,129.86],[129.86,130.34],[130.34,130.48],[130.48,131.04],[131.04,131.11],[131.11,131.31],[131.31,131.73],[131.73,132.28],[132.28,132.49],[132.49,133.11],[133.11,133.25],[133.25,133.46],[133.46,134.22]]},{"el":"h5","text":"Presencia local","start":135.53,"end":136.77,"words":[[135.61,136.32],[136.32,136.72]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Los fiscales de distrito, alguaciles y concejos municipales deciden cómo se usa a la policía, y a menudo se eligen por unos pocos miles de votos.","start":137.47,"end":147.1,"words":[[137.6,137.81],[137.81,138.38],[138.38,138.52],[138.52,139.15],[139.39,140.1],[140.1,140.17],[140.17,140.73],[140.73,141.5],[141.5,142.0],[142.0,142.28],[142.28,142.42],[142.42,142.63],[142.63,142.7],[142.7,142.84],[142.84,143.47],[143.72,143.79],[143.79,143.86],[143.86,144.28],[144.28,144.42],[144.42,144.84],[144.84,145.05],[145.05,145.33],[145.33,145.69],[145.69,146.04],[146.04,146.18],[146.18,146.6]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Regístrate, verifica tu registro y vota en las elecciones locales.","start":147.45,"end":152.44,"words":[[147.56,148.37],[148.63,149.22],[149.22,149.36],[149.36,149.95],[149.95,150.03],[150.03,150.32],[150.32,150.47],[150.47,150.69],[150.69,151.43],[151.43,152.02]]}]}